)" class="transition-all"></circle></svg><span class="grid flex-1 *:my-auto *:row-start-1 *:col-start-1"><span class="truncate transition-[opacity,translate,color]">Overview</span><span class="truncate transition-[opacity,translate] opacity-0 translate-y-full pointer-events-none"></span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 transition-transform mx-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2lubt6cnql5b_" hidden="" data-toc-popover-content="" class="overflow-hidden"></div></header></div><main class="grid [grid-area:main] justify-items-center" data-layout-main=""><article id="nd-page" data-layout-content="" data-full="false" class="flex flex-col min-w-0 w-full max-w-[900px] px-4 py-6 gap-4 md:px-6 md:pt-8 xl:px-8 xl:pt-14"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground"><a class="truncate transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/self-hosting">Self Hosting</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a class="truncate text-fd-primary font-medium transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/self-hosting">Overview</a></div><div class="prose flex-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center sm:absolute sm:max-w-[15rem] sm:justify-end right-0 top-[-62px]"><span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border bg-stripe-pattern text-text-secondary">Version: v4</span><div class="group relative inline-flex items-center p-1 button-wrapper"><span aria-hidden="true" class="corner-box-hover-child"></span><div class="inline-flex h-[26px] items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-[1px] border border-line-structure dark:border-line-cta bg-surface-bg text-text-secondary [box-shadow:0_4px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05),0_4px_4px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center px-[8px] py-0.75 font-sans text-[12px] font-[450] leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.06px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] transition-colors min-w-[80px] max-w-[160px] overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-1/80"><span class="truncate">Copy page</span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open copy options" class="inline-flex w-[24px] items-center justify-center border-l border-line-structure transition-colors cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-1/80" id="radix-_R_1a5klubt6cnql5b_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><h1 id="self-host-langfuse" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#self-host-langfuse">Self-host Langfuse</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h1>
<p>Langfuse is open source and can be self-hosted using Docker on your own infrastructure. Some add-on features require a <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/license-key">license key</a>.</p>
<p>When self-hosting Langfuse, you run the same infrastructure that powers Langfuse Cloud. Read <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/why">&quot;Why Langfuse?&quot;</a> to learn more about why this is important to us.</p>
<h2 id="deployment-options" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#deployment-options">Deployment options</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><table class="my-0! w-full h-full text-sm caption-bottom border-none"><thead><tr><th>Best for</th><th>Deployment</th><th>Responsibility</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fastest start</td><td><a href="https://cloud.langfuse.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">Langfuse Cloud</a></td><td>Fully managed by the Langfuse team</td></tr><tr><td>Local use and testing</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/docker-compose">Docker Compose</a></td><td>Single VM without high availability, scaling, or backups</td></tr><tr><td>Production self-hosting</td><td><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/kubernetes-helm">Kubernetes (Helm)</a>, <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/aws">AWS</a>, <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/azure">Azure</a>, <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/gcp">GCP</a>, <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/render">Render</a> (community), or <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/deployment/railway">Railway</a> (community)</td><td>Your infrastructure</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<p>Unless marked as community-supported, these deployment options are maintained and tested by the Langfuse team. Community-supported options are maintained in third-party repositories and supported on a best-effort basis. Report problems via <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/issues">GitHub issues</a>.</p>
<h2 id="architecture" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#architecture">Architecture</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>Langfuse only depends on open source components and can be deployed locally, on cloud infrastructure, or on-premises.</p>
<!-- -->
<figure class="not-prose _0iyPUa_figure" aria-label="Langfuse self-hosting architecture"><div class="_0iyPUa_header"><span class="_0iyPUa_eyebrow">Deployment architecture</span></div><div class="_0iyPUa_desktop"><svg viewBox="-8 0 808 760" class="_0iyPUa_diagram" role="group" aria-label="Web and worker containers connected to four shared storage services, with an optional AI gateway"><desc>UI, API, and SDK clients connect to Langfuse Web. Web connects to PostgreSQL, Redis or Valkey, ClickHouse, and S3 or blob storage. Redis queues jobs for Langfuse Worker, which connects to PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, and S3. Both containers can optionally connect to LLM providers: Web for the playground, Worker for evaluations. The optional Langfuse AI gateway receives model requests from applications and coding agents, resolves gateway keys and uploads traces through Langfuse Web, and relays the requests to the LLM providers. The application containers, gateway, and storage run in your VPC or on-premises. The LLM providers can also run in the same VPC or a peered VPC.</desc><rect x="20" y="104" width="760" height="528" rx="12" class="_0iyPUa_boundary"></rect><text x="760" y="136" text-anchor="end" class="_0iyPUa_detail">VPC / on-premises</text><g transform="translate(40 24)"><rect width="200" height="54" rx="8" class="_0iyPUa_card"></rect><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe _0iyPUa_icon" x="16" y="17" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg><text x="46" y="33" class="_0iyPUa_name">UI, API &amp; SDKs</text></g><g transform="translate(300 24)"><rect width="200" height="54" rx="8" class="_0iyPUa_card"></rect><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" s