</text><text x="646" y="620" text-anchor="end" class="_0iyPUa_detail">Evaluations</text><text x="36" y="500" class="_0iyPUa_detail">Relay</text><a href="/self-hosting/configuration/ai-gateway" class="_0iyPUa_service" aria-label="AI Gateway: Optional · beta. View documentation."><g transform="translate(40 168)" class="_0iyPUa_gateway"><rect width="200" height="126" rx="8" class="_0iyPUa_card"></rect><path d="M 16 0 H 184" class="_0iyPUa_accent"></path><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-waypoints _0iyPUa_icon" x="16" y="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10.586 5.414-5.172 5.172"></path><path d="m18.586 13.414-5.172 5.172"></path><path d="M6 12h12"></path><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="2"></circle><circle cx="4" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><text x="46" y="33" class="_0iyPUa_name">AI Gateway</text><text x="16" y="59" class="_0iyPUa_detail">Optional · beta</text><path d="M 16 77 H 184" class="_0iyPUa_divider"></path><text x="16" y="102" class="_0iyPUa_image">langfuse/ai-gateway</text></g></a><a href="/self-hosting/deployment/infrastructure/containers" class="_0iyPUa_service" aria-label="Langfuse Web: UI &amp; API server. View documentation."><g transform="translate(40 334)" class="_0iyPUa_web"><rect width="200" height="126" rx="8" class="_0iyPUa_card"></rect><path d="M 16 0 H 184" class="_0iyPUa_accent"></path><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-server _0iyPUa_icon" x="16" y="18" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line 