<h2 id="subscribe" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#subscribe">Subscribe to updates</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<!-- -->
<p>Release notes are published on <a href="https://github.com/langfuse/langfuse/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal">GitHub</a>. Langfuse uses tagged semver releases (<a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/upgrade/versioning">versioning policy</a>).</p>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))">✉️<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p><strong><a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/oss-newsletter">Langfuse OSS updates</a></strong> — get an email when we ship important features and new releases for self-hosted (open source) Langfuse. Self-hosting updates only, no spam.</p><form class="flex gap-y-2 w-full flex-row items-center mt-3 mb-1 max-w-sm"><input type="email" class="flex w-full rounded-[2px] border border-line-structure bg-surface-bg px-2 text-base text-text-secondary shadow-sm file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-text-primary placeholder:text-text-disabled focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-line-cta focus-visible:ring-offset-1 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-bg disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm flex-1 min-w-0 rounded-r-none z-10 py-0 dark:border-line-cta h-[26px]" placeholder="email" value=""/><div class="relative flex max-w-full items-center p-1 group button-wrapper cursor-pointer has-[:disabled]:cursor-not-allowed w-auto shrink-0 max-h-[34px]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="corner-box-hover-child"></span><button class="rounded-[2px] border [box-shadow:0_4px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.05),0_4px_4px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full items-center no-underline overflow-hidden py-0.75 shadow-sm transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border-line-structure dark:border-line-cta group-hover:border-line-cta bg-surface-bg text-text-secondary h-[26px] pl-[8px] pr-[8px] w-auto gap-3 justify-center" type="submit"><span class="flex items-center min-w-0 truncate font-sans text-[12px] font-[450] leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.06px] [font-variant-numeric:ordinal] p-0" aria-hidden="true">Subscribe</span></button></div></form></div></div></div></div>
<p>You can also watch the GitHub releases to get notified about new releases:</p>
<div data-media-player="" role="region" aria-label="Media Player" data-orientation="portrait" aria-busy="true" data-load="visible" data-autoplay="" data-can-seek="" data-loop="" data-media-type="unknown" data-muted="" data-paused="" data-playsinline="" data-remote-state="disconnected" data-remote-type="none" data-stream-type="unknown" data-view-type="unknown" class="overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-surface-bg object-cover max-w-md block" tabindex="0" style="aspect-ratio:1.7887596899224807"><div data-media-provider=""><video playsInline="" webkit-playsinline="" controls=""><source src="https://static.langfuse.com/docs-videos/github-subscribe-releases.mp4"/></video></div></div><hr/>
<p>If you experience any issues when self-hosting Langfuse, please:</p>
<ol>
<li>Check out <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/self-hosting/troubleshooting-and-faq">Troubleshooting &amp; FAQ</a> page.</li>
<li>Use <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/docs/ask-ai">Ask AI</a> to get instant answers to your questions.</li>
<li>Ask the maintainers on <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/gh-support">GitHub Discussions</a>.</li>
<li>Create a bug report or feature request on <a class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1 text-text-links underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 decoration-text-links hover:text-primary hover:decoration-primary font-normal" href="/issues">GitHub</a>.</li>
</ol>
<div class="relative bg-surface-bg border border-line-structure corner-box-corners callout"><div class="bg-stripe-pattern callout-stripe-fade flex border p-4 gap-2 text-sm text-primary" style="--callout-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted));--stripe-color:var(--callout-info, var(--color-fd-muted))"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" class="size-4 mt-0.5 text-(--callout-color)"><g><path d="M7 12.25C9.8995 12.25 12.25 9.8995 12.25 7C12.25 4.10051 9.8995 1.75 7 1.75C4.10051 1.75 1.75 4.10051 1.75 7C1.75 9.8995 4.10051 12.25 7 12.25Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5625 6.5625C6.67853 6.5625 6.78981 6.60859 6.87186 6.69064C6.95391 6.77269 7 6.88397 7 7V9.1875C7 9.30353 7.04609 9.41481 7.12814 9.49686C7.21019 9.57891 7.32147 9.625 7.4375 9.625" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.875" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.78125 5.25C7.14369 5.25 7.4375 4.95619 7.4375 4.59375C7.4375 4.23131 7.14369 3.9375 6.78125 3.9375C6.41881 3.9375 6.125 4.23131 6.125 4.59375C6.125 4.95619 6.41881 5.25 6.78125 5.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-text-secondary text-[14px] prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><p>Enterprise-grade support is available when self-hosting Langfuse. Learn more on
